    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Couple-Cultivation Saves the World] is a first-person live interactive game. As the male protagonist, you accidentally discover that your family\u2019s art seem to significantly enhance the power of girls from another world. As the best cultivation power bank in Jiuqiu, are you willing to help diverse girls practice Couple-Cultivation to boost their power, save the Earth, and maintain peace in Jiuqiu?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rourou: Your classmate who is also a rich kid and the shop manager. This love is possible, half a life of trusting, but for your sake, the path is tortuous</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257360/extras/1a11591513a8a265644c7435694dcd8f.avif?t=1733543578\" width=618 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baize: A female warrior from the other world called the Realm of Canwei. She feels what all things feel, know all about devil and god. All her life she uses, to guard the eternal peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257360/extras/8bc1de9589914efbf98116ddfa1a8a1f.avif?t=1733543578\" width=618 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zhuxin: A healer from the other world called the Realm of Canwei. The bamboo transformed from Xuannv, the heart shows when the bamboo splits, so it be her name, Bamboo Heart[Zhu xin]. Born and raised by nature, never fed by the mundane world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257360/extras/3728f6851284b0c0fc3e51ee33e21092.avif?t=1733543578\" width=618 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wushuang: A female general from the other world called the Realm of Canwei. The plum blossoms transformed from Xuannv, when they fell without frost on them, so it be her name, No Frost[Wu shuang]. As the queen of the Snow Kingdom, overseeing the heart of snow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257360/extras/0c2e56da30bca3666bee0aa0a6e35c74.avif?t=1733543578\" width=618 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jiuyin: The starter of the war in the Realm of Canwei. The longing turns into illness, the mirage of the moon in water.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Product Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Immersive First-Person Perspective: Allowing the players to experience intimate interactions with different beauties, and Couple-Cultivate to save the earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Action Rating Gameplay: You can rate performances of the girls. The higher the score, the better the cultivation effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiple Branches and Endings: Players can choose to pursue their favorite girl, and achieve exclusive endings with her or them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Four Diverse Female Characters: Distinct personalities - sweet, gentle and firm, willful, or sexy. Can you recognize your true feelings, and distinguish between &quot;love&quot; and &quot;desire&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
